+# UI demo implementation — 18 October 2026
+
+Implemented the P0 in the Windows workspace reference
+`plans/ui-demo/implementation-plan.md` in this Laravel/Vue project.
+
+## Delivered
+
+- Project overview: preparation/readiness, first-scan empty state, start via the
+  existing POST, compact live summary, history and source-replacement Dialog.
+- Preparation for a replacement snapshot reuses the existing jobs, creating the
+  missing Lab when necessary. Read-only requests do not start work.
+- Permanent scan page with Activity/Findings, status/search filters, elapsed time,
+  budget consumed and four distinct outcome counts. Unknown values stay unknown.
+- Finding detail from persisted DTO fields, bounded source and HTTP previews,
+  missing/truncated states and lazy Shiki highlighting with plain-text fallback.
+- Saved HTML report, browser print and authorized JSON/Markdown exports.
+- Incremental checkpoint import during Docker execution, idempotent upserts,
+  withdrawal reconciliation and retained results on failure. Existing Python
+  checkpoints and model-facing contracts remain unchanged.
+- Database-backed SSE for overview/detail, persistent cursor, reconnect and a
+  bounded public activity list. Reports stay unavailable during finalization.
+
+## Routes and state
+
+All product routes are under `/projects/{project}/audit-runs/{run}`:
+base page, `/events`, `/findings/{lead}`, `/report` and
+`/report/export?format=json|markdown`. Each checks owner and resource membership.
+The existing `/audit-runs/{auditRun}/progress` JSON route remains available.
+
+`audit_runs.progress` stores absolute usage, coverage and the last 100 public
+events. Hash/time/version identify acquisitions. `audit_run_leads.is_current`
+excludes withdrawn leads without deleting historical payloads. The terminal DTO
+remains the final report source; saved checkpoints can form a labelled partial
+report after failure. Neither usage percentage nor elapsed time claims completion.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Production frontend build passed; targeted PHP syntax checks passed.
+- TypeScript reported no errors in the added/changed UI. The full project check
+  remains blocked by pre-existing demo components (missing Tabler/DnD/Zod imports,
+  missing Vue imports/table typing) and the generated RedirectController query
+  method. These unrelated files were not changed.
+- Offline database replay: intermediate envelope normalization, first lead before
+  finalization, idempotency, verdict/absolute-usage updates, pinned archived source,
+  identity rejection, terminal withdrawal, finalization/report gate, failure
+  retention, export, ownership, duplicate start and replacement preparation.
+- Process facade simulation: asynchronous checkpoints/output and container cleanup
+  after unexpected monitor failure. No Docker audit or provider request was run.
+- Browser: desktop 1440px/mobile 390px, light/dark, empty/results/blocked/missing
+  evidence, Shiki, filters, both exports and upload Dialog keyboard close. No
+  horizontal overflow or JavaScript page errors in these checks. Simulated live
+  producer updated verdict/budget and revealed the report without page reload.
+
+Deploy the additive migration and use concurrent PHP workers with unbuffered SSE.
+The default single-worker PHP dev server may delay other requests during an open
+stream. A real end-to-end audit was deliberately not run.
+
+## Deferred
+
+P1: mascot/sprite, cancellation, GitHub, editable targets/actors, retest and billing.
+P2: generated PDF, global sidebar, collaboration, automations and trends.
